# L5: la porta esistente scrive un tratto, il fallback lo legge, il ritiro
# lo toglie. Ablazione precisa dei tre tratti stipulati, KB viva completa.
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset
!forget context_fact(imagination, like, you, "quiet places")
!forget context_fact(imagination, prefer, you, "temples to museums")
!forget context_fact(imagination, love, you, "reading in the rain")

[test the_same_question_changes_after_natural_teaching]
!timeout 5
> What specific sights or experiences are you most interested in?
<~ nobody has taught me
> In your imagination, you like old libraries.
<~ Held, but only in imagination
!query holds_in(world_of(parrot0_imagination), fact(like, parrot0, "old libraries"))
!query! like(parrot0, "old libraries")
!query context_commitment(world_of(parrot0_imagination), imagined_only)
> What specific sights or experiences are you most interested in?
<~ In my imagination, I like old libraries. What appeals to you about that?
> Do you prefer temples or museums?
<~ In my imagination, I like old libraries.

[test withdrawing_the_trait_removes_its_voice]
!timeout 5
> Forget your imagined interest in old libraries.
<~ I no longer hold that imagined interest in old libraries.
!query! holds_in(world_of(parrot0_imagination), fact(like, parrot0, "old libraries"))
> What specific sights or experiences are you most interested in?
<~ nobody has taught me

[test another_relation_uses_the_same_reader]
!timeout 5
> In your imagination, you love long walks.
<~ Held, but only in imagination
> What specific sights or experiences are you most interested in?
<~ In my imagination, I love long walks.
> Forget your imagined interest in long walks.
!query! self_has_imagined_trait
